Read these before changing delivery behavior:

- `/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent/docs/extensions.md` — `pi.sendMessage`, `pi.sendUserMessage`, `pi.appendEntry`, and renderer APIs.
